          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "6c1f78e3f0d7486397b7d37f047129b5"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "NTPS and TFS catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** National Center for Education Statistics.\n- **Access:** Public-use custom extracts through NCES DataLab; restricted-use files require a license.\n- **Unit:** Sampled school, teacher, principal, and follow-up teacher record.\n- **Coverage:** NTPS cycles every two to three years; predecessor SASS/TFS series extends to 1987.\n- **Geography:** School, state, and nation.\n- **Join keys:** Survey cycle, permitted school identifier, teacher or principal record, and state.\n- **Measures:** Staffing, qualifications, work conditions, professional development, retention, and mobility.\n- **Uses:** Teacher-workforce, retention, and implementation context.\n\nUse survey weights and cycle-specific documentation. This nationally representative survey is contextual evidence, not a local-program impact evaluation.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
